{"term": {"label": "德", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "務", "id": "務"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "德", "variants": [], "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "忘", "id": "忘"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "長", "id": "長"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.114532861491106, "source": "心", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 0.8023464725249373, "source": "心", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.575536360758419, "source": "心", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 0.7282385003712155, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.8823891801984737, "source": "心", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.9810014688665833, "source": "心", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.0159205728229963, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.6741486494265287, "source": "忘", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.0159205728229963, "source": "忘", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.6741486494265287, "source": "忘", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "忘", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.13370360847938, "source": "禮", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "禮", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.826850789039325, "source": "禮", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.6933193964148026, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.341342